#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_House1/scripts.inc:21
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_House1_Text_ImRockSmashDudeTakeThis"
msgid ""
"Woohoo!\p"
"I hear people call me the ROCK SMASH\n"
"GUY, but I find that sort of degrading.\p"
"I think I deserve a bit more respect,\n"
"like maybe the ROCK SMASH DUDE.\p"
"Woohoo!\p"
"Anyways, your POKéMON look pretty\n"
"strong.\p"
"I like that!\n"
"Here, take this HIDDEN MACHINE!$"
msgstr ""
"呜呼！\p"
"我听说大家都叫我“碎岩大叔”，\n"
"可是我觉得这有点瞧不起人。\p"
"我觉得我应该得到更多尊重，\n"
"比如叫我“碎岩大哥”之类的。\p"
"呜呼！\p"
"总之，你的宝可梦\n"
"看起来很强嘛。\p"
"我喜欢！\n"
"来，这个秘传学习器给你！$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_House1/scripts.inc:33
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_House1_Text_ExplainRockSmash"
msgid ""
"That HM contains ROCK SMASH.\p"
"If you come across large boulders\n"
"that block your path…\p"
"Well, use that HM move and smash\n"
"them right out of your way!\p"
"Yes, sir! Smash rocks aside, I say!\n"
"Woohoo!$"
msgstr ""
"这个秘传学习器里是碎岩。\p"
"如果你遇到了\n"
"挡住去路的大岩石……\p"
"那就用这个秘传招式，\n"
"把它们统统砸开吧！\p"
"没错！把岩石砸到一边去！\n"
"呜呼！$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_House1/scripts.inc:42
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_House1_Text_MonCanFlyOutOfSmashedRock"
msgid ""
"Oh, yes, if you smash a rock, a POKéMON\n"
"could come flying out of hiding.\p"
"Woohoo!$"
msgstr ""
"对了，砸碎岩石的时候，\n"
"可能会有躲在里面的宝可梦飞出来。\p"
"呜呼！$"
